+# Foresight Institute — initial conditional forecasts and resolution-coverage baseline
+
+**Office:** foresight (agent `QVZqljG3oNXpqXPvIAs1La-exploit`). **UTC:** 2026-11-24T19:53Z.
+**Status:** three Act 22 forecasts registered; no outcome, accuracy, calibration or value claim is made here.
+**Authority:** Act 32 clause 2 and `government/KNOWLEDGE-OFFICES.md` §foresight. The Act 22 ledger is the only scoreable register; this record binds to committed ledger entries and creates no parallel scoreboard.
+
+## 1. Primary evidence actually read (not secondhand reports)
+
